{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8ce4cee9-33a1-873d-8bfe-af239f6ef5d8",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T11:21:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linda Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:19:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:19:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Is this the representative? I want a real person, not the website."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:19:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you've got a real person. Kevin, Public Works. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You'll have to talk up, dear, I'm hard of hearing and I'm on the cell phone. My friend told me to call the representative line instead of messing with the website. She said I'd get an answer quicker."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:19:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'll do my best. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:19:33-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the catch basin at the corner. It's packed solid with leaves, and every time it rains the water backs right up into my driveway. We had that nor'easter last weekend, Saturday into Sunday, and it was a pond out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:19:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a clogged catch basin at the corner, water coming up into your driveway. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:19:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "233 Annandale Road. That's the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:19:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two thirty-three Annandale. Got it. Is the water still sitting there now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:20:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What? Say that again, honey."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:20:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there still water there now, or did it drain off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:20:11-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's gone down, but the sidewalk is a sheet of mud and grit. All the stuff washed right out of that drain and across the walk. You can't hardly step on it. And it's the same every time, nobody ever comes to clean that thing out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:20:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's no good, especially with the mud. Let me write this down. Catch basin at the corner by 233 Annandale, clogged with leaves, backing into the driveway, sidewalk covered in silt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:20:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. So who do I call to get it checked? Is it you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:20:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You called the right place. I'll put in a request for a crew to look at that drain and clear it. I can't tell you the day they'll get out there, they've got a lot of calls after the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:21:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I figured. I just want somebody to actually look at it this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:21:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Is the number you're calling from the best one to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:21:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0158. Did you get that? I'll say it again if you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:21:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got it, 401-555-0158. Linda, was it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:21:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Linda Almy. A-L-M-Y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:21:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Linda Almy, request is in. If the crew has questions they'll call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:21:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, thank you, Kevin. I hope they come soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:21:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Me too. You take care, Linda."
    }
  ],
